# Review ownership (plan: "Governance"). GitHub resolves the LAST matching rule, so specific paths
# come after the default. A team's rules list exactly the GitHub handles in its
# config/teams/<team>.yaml metadata.owners (D15). tests/policy/test_codeowners.py fails if a team
# or source file, or a security-critical path, has no rule of its own, or if a team's rules and
# owners differ.

